<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main>
  <h2>Delete your account</h2>
  <p><strong>This is permanent and cannot be undone.</strong></p>
  <p>Want a copy first? <a href="/account/export">Download your data</a>.</p>

  <p>You currently have <%= summary.posts %> post(s), <%= summary.messages %> sent message(s) and <%= summary.friends %> friend(s).</p>

  <h3>What will be deleted</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Your profile, picture, posts, likes, bookmarks, friends, blocks, mutes and notifications.</li>
    <li>Replies and reposts that other people made to your posts disappear together with those posts.</li>
    <li>Direct messages you sent or received are deleted for both people, including pictures.</li>
    <li>Messages you sent in groups are deleted. Groups you created are handed to another member, or deleted if nobody else is in them.</li>
    <li>Reports you filed stay with the moderators, without your name.</li>
    <li>Your username becomes available for anyone to register.</li>
  </ul>

  <form method="POST" action="/account/delete">
    <label>Your password
      <input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="yes" required>
      I understand this cannot be undone
    </label>
    <button>Delete my account</button>
    <a href="/profile">Cancel</a>
  </form>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
